95. "What kind of works did Wilde write?"
96. "'Salome,' 'The Picture of Dorian Gray,' 'The Critic as Artist,' 'The Decay of Lying'..."
97. "I've never even heard of any of them besides Salome."
98. 　No, I felt like I might have heard of the last two...
