4. "After what he did, isn't it obvious?"
5. "That's not what I meant -- why is he even being allowed across the art club's threshold?\nWasn't he the one guy we should've made confess the truth and get expelled?"
6. "Like I said, it wouldn't work out so neatly. Even if the truth came out, it'd be 'both parties equally at fault.' We'd all be expelled together."
