12. "Sketch?"
13. "Well? Pretty surprising, right? He may look and act like this, but he's got real talent."
14. "Producing a sketch like this in the middle of that uproar isn't something an ordinary person can do. He's genuinely skilled."
15. "The fact that his creative drive only kicks in for nudes is a problem, but his skill is the real thing. He's a necessary asset."
16. "Necessary asset?! You're actually going to admit this guy into the club?"
17. "That's right."
18. "Why would you go so far as to shield this guy?"
19. "It's my long-cherished ambition."
20. "Long-cherished ambition?"
21. "Yes. I intend to see it through.\nSo if someone has talent, I'll admit them, no matter how much of a personality problem they are."
22. "Even so... you're really letting this guy in?"
23. "He saw Kei's maid outfit in one video and stayed up all night sewing three costumes -- that drive is warped, but it's impressive. It's not something you can pull off just by wanting to."
24. "So he really did prepare all that in a single day?"
25. "Seems so. Apparently the plan came to him the moment the sketch session was mentioned."
