102. "Oh, you actually sound like an older brother for once..."
103. "If anything happens with you, I'll wind up saddled with the duty of inheriting Kusanagi Ken'ichirou's estate, so watch yourself."
104. "You don't need to warn me -- I don't have any inheritance from Kusanagi Ken'ichirou to speak of!"
