17. "So anyway, off you go. This old lady's gonna stick it out here a while longer."
18. Kawachino plopped herself down beside Hikawa.
19. The naturalness of it took me a bit by surprise.
20. Kawachino, from what I've seen, hasn't opened her heart to almost anyone...
