123. "I only brought my school-issued swimsuit, so that would really help me out.\n
124. It's the shopping mall near the seaside park, right?"
125. "Then let's wrap up a little early today and all go together."
126. "That sounds nice... picking out swimsuits with just the girls... how tantalizing."
127. "Yesss, we're all going together."
128. "Ouch!"
