47. [NARRATION] Which meant the place and the date of execution were both narrowed down.
48. [Naoya] "But your taste really is nasty, you know.\n
49. [Naoya] The reason you knew I was investigating the church was because you already knew there was something at that church yourself, right?"
50. [Makoto] "Sort of correct."
51. [Makoto] "I don't know what's at that church.\n
