106. [Naoya] but anyway, you all just enjoy yourselves without me."
107. [Makoto] "After all this, you're still not coming?\n
108. [Makoto] Honestly, so cold-hearted."
109. [Naoya] "Cold-hearted's fine, isn't it...\n
110. [Naoya] Heartless would be 'without heart,' after all."
111. [Makoto] "What kind of dad joke is that... how idiotic."
112. [Naoya] "You're right. That really was a dad joke..."
113. [Makoto] "Heading back?"
114. [Naoya] "Yeah, guess so.\n
115. [Naoya] I still need to take a look at Rin and Kawachino's paintings."
116. [Makoto] "Heh, you're a bad liar..."
117. [Naoya] "Did you say something?"
