120. [Makoto] If it's too dark, you won't be able to investigate, will you?"
121. [Naoya] "Yeah, yeah, Toritani sees through everything..."
122. [Makoto] "If I saw through everything, I wouldn't have struggled this much...\n
123. [Makoto] Honestly... why didn't I notice back in April..."
124. [NARRATION] Toritani muttered bitterly.
125. [Naoya] "I'll be off, then."
126. [Makoto] "Yes, yes, take care."
