63. [Yumi] "Whew...... what incredible power it has."
64. [NARRATION] It delights those who make it, and what's completed is this......
65. [NARRATION] What kind of brain did that guy have?
66. [Naoya] "Kusanagi Ken'ichirou's posthumous work...... is complete......"
67. [Thomas] "Oh no."
68. [Thomas] "I never got a single chance.\n
69. [Thomas] It is heartless-u. This world is nothing but impermanence-u."
70. [NARRATION] We washed away with water the ink we had used as coordinates.
71. [NARRATION] And the work revealed its complete form.
72. [NARRATION] The cherry blossom petals are the children's footprints.
73. [NARRATION] To bring out all the petals, a faintly reddish white was laid down as the base.
74. [NARRATION] Against that faintly cherry-tinted background, the footprints\n
75. [NARRATION] appear like cherry blossom petals floating up as if they were phantoms.
76. [NARRATION] Seen from a distance, it gives a sense of depth, creating the illusion that there are far more petals than those actually fixed to the wall.
77. [NARRATION] And then the stained glass.
78. [NARRATION] Within the stained glass stretches a blue sky that seems to go on infinitely.
79. [NARRATION] The cherry blossom petals are drawn into that infinite sky as well.
80. [NARRATION] Only, within the sky, those petals have transformed into wings.
81. [NARRATION] From children's footprints, into cherry blossom petals, and then, by dancing in the void, they change into angels' wings.
82. [NARRATION] A magnificent composition.
83. [NARRATION] A magnificent design.
84. [NARRATION] And an all too magnificent thematic depth.
85. [Naoya] "It's about time the priest woke up, huh?"
86. [Naoya] "Any regrets?"
87. [Akashi] "A foolish question......"
88. [NARRATION] Shouting could be heard from the direction of the school building.
89. [NARRATION] Had the teacher on night duty woken up?
90. [NARRATION] In any case, someone was running toward us at tremendous speed.
91. [Naoya] "This means expulsion."
92. [Akashi] "If we don't get arrested by the police, we can count ourselves lucky......"
93. [NARRATION] Akashi and I laughed together.
94. [NARRATION] I wonder if he's watching. The priest.
95. [NARRATION] And Kusanagi Ken'ichirou......

