19. Teachers really are nothing but a bunch of tasteless philistines!"
20. "It was me! All responsibility lies with me, Akashi Wataru.\n
21. I was the one who lured these kids into it!\n
22. So take me away, if you please!"
23. "Idiot, you think it ends there?! All of you, come with me!"
24. "O-ow..."
25. "They have nothing to do with it! Don't be so rough with them!"
26. "These children will not resist. Please refrain from being too rough with them."
