99. Far better than everything falling apart..."
100. It was an hour later that I was summoned to the headmaster's office.
101. "Pardon the intrusion..."
102. When I knocked, bowed, and entered, someone was already there.
103. Akashi.
104. "Just Akashi? Where are the others?"
105. "Hey, you, don't run your mouth."
106. "So, to continue the discussion..."
