=== lines=123 stop_reason=end_turn in=4969 out=3088 cache_read=3222 cache_create=0 last_entry_continued=0 ===
1. "If Kawachino finds out I called Hikawa out, she'd probably be mad, and that's scary too..."
2. Now that I actually had to contact someone, it turned out to be its own headache.
3. "I-I'm getting even more confused..."
4. I kept walking for another few dozen minutes as I agonized over it, and the scenery grew even less familiar. I don't know why, but it feels like the mountains are getting closer...
5. There was no point thinking about it any longer, so I called the first phone number that caught my eye.
6. "What's the matter? This is Kusanagi-kun, right?"
7. "Yeah, it's Kusanagi. Kusanagi Naoya.\n
8. I've kind of gotten myself into a mess..."
9. "A mess?"
10. I told Rin the whole story.\n
11. She didn't laugh, wasn't surprised -- she just listened seriously.
12. "I see... in that case, it must be around this area..."
13. "This area?"
14. "Ah, I was listening to your explanation while spreading out a map.\n
15. I thought maybe I could pin down your location from the direction you first set off in, the time, and the features of the terrain."
