87. That guy -- he probably knew everything......
88. In the morning, I headed to the hospital.
89. As early as possible. I entered before the examinations and such would begin.
90. "There's something I want to ask you, old man."
91. "Do you know Misakura Rin?"
92. For an instant, the old man's expression seemed to stiffen.\nBut in the next moment, it returned to his usual mocking look.
