119. "Rin, she turned the road into a mirror and inverted the world."
120. "Turned the road into a mirror? Inverted the world? What's that supposed to mean?"
121. "She had drawn a landscape of the scene visible from that road, filling the whole road with it. The draftsmanship was so precise, that alone shook me."
