143. "That's why -- that's exactly what Misakura Rin can do."
144. "A world drawn with something as ephemeral as wax stone, on a road no less. The illusion that that side is the real one."
145. "It's Rin who makes that possible."
146. "What is that? Isn't that just your imagination, old man? Her draftsmanship was just so tremendous that for a moment it looked that way......"

