23. [Naoya] "Exactly. Tonight I'll devote all my time just to adjusting the springs -- how far they move in each direction, how to move the canvas as I apply the brush......"
24. [Naoya] "Well, it's grueling work."
25. [Friedman] "So? I understand the forgery method. But have you thought through the concept for the seven-part series? Painting six more cherry trees isn't going to convince anyone."
26. [Naoya] "Yeah, I know."
