73. [Kuzu] "Your creative image?"
74. [Naoya] "Yeah. Right now I'm trying to make new cherry blossoms bloom.\nThat's probably why......"
75. [Naoya] "The cherry blossoms I was gazing at are the ones I'm about to make bloom."
76. [Kuzu] "Naoya, so you really are painting?"
77. [Kuzu] "Is it -- possibly...... for my sake?"
78. [Naoya] "No, I don't know. It's not really for anyone else's sake."
