91. This much can be done well enough with my current left hand.
92. [Naoya] "His paintings are burned completely into my head, after all......"
93. I paint for a week straight.
94. I took up the brush as if possessed.
95. When I take up the brush, all sorts of things cross my heart.
96. Not only good feelings, by any means.
97. No, rather, the body gets steeped in bad feelings.
98. Distracting thoughts rise up and try to stop the brush.
99. Ah, this feeling......
100. I remember it well. This feeling.
