1. [Akashi] "K-Kusanagi...... Looks like I have to revise the image I've had of you until now......"
2. [Naoya] "Revise it how?"
3. [Akashi] "N-no...... I knew Kusanagi Naoya had been called a prodigy, and I've seen your 'Sakura Day Rhapsody' many times...... but I hadn't grasped at all just how much talent you have right now."
4. [Naoya] "Disappointed?"
5. [Akashi] "Idiot! Why on earth did you quit painting?! A picture like this, most people can't paint. Kei and Toritani aren't even in your league."
6. [Naoya] "That's wrong. This is nothing more than a forgery. Its impact only works because that great original, 'The Reclining Sakura,' exists."
7. [Naoya] "I'm the one not even in Kei or Toritani's league.\nI can churn out any amount of fakes, but never the real thing. That's all I am."
8. [Akashi] "No, no -- to personify the sakura to this degree, to make its interior look like flesh and blood, is incredible...... Look closely and it's just the trunk split open with sap dripping down, and yet......"
