38. [NARRATION] No -- certainly that was supposed to be the purpose.
39. [NARRATION] But with that kind of feeling, one couldn't paint at this level.
40. [NARRATION] Through this six-part series, I'm coming to feel something concretely.
41. [NARRATION] 'The Reclining Sakura,' painted to be offered up to my mother, Mizuna.
