1. "Read it with an online translator or something."
2. "But it was such a paaain."
3. "Anyway, you're the one who's most at fault for not checking the pledge."
4. "You didn't check it either, did ya!"
5. "I didn't even see it!"
6. "It's your fault for not looking!"
