1. [Naoya] "Yeah, so you don't need to use a false name anymore. You don't have to hide either.\nYou can live in the place you were always meant to be, under your true name."
2. [Naoya] "From today on, you're free."
3. [Kuzu] "B-but, Naoya......"
4. [Naoya] "Like I said, I just settled the inheritance. Sure, I couldn't actually inherit anything, but well, that was decided from the start."
5. [Kuzu] "Naoya...... then I have nothing I can give back to you."
6. [Naoya] "In that case. We made a promise once, didn't we. That you'd eat food I cooked."
7. [Kuzu] "Yeah, but, that isn't enough to thank you."
8. [Naoya] "I'm telling you it's fine.\nSomeday when everything settles down and you can go back completely to your old life, that's when I want you to come see me."
9. [Naoya] "I'll feed you a meal."
10. [Kuzu] "Yeah...... okay."
