86. [Ken'ichirou] "Still, to be scolded just for saying her name -- well, she was a yakuza, so I suppose it can't be helped."
87. [Ai] "So the girl's surname is Misakura...... hm, good.\nI thought you might tell me she went by Kusanagi."
