89. [Ai] "Yes, yes, I know very well that you love only Mizuna-neesama.\nAnd that there is no room for anyone else to slip in."
90. [Ken'ichirou] "Then why say something like that?"
91. [Ai] "Now, why indeed. Maybe because you're too popular, Ken'ichirou?"
92. [Ken'ichirou] "What are you on about, acting like you understand things at your age......"
93. [Ai] "Ha, ha, ha, ha. 'At my age' -- how rude of you, Ken'ichirou. Shall I greet you with a punch like old times?"
94. [Ken'ichirou] "I'll pass, thanks. More importantly --\nwhat about you, Rin? Tea all right?"
95. [Rin] "No. Tea is bitter, I don't want any."
96. [Ken'ichirou] "There you have it."
97. [Ai] "I see. And we've run out of juice."
98. [Rin] "Don't trouble yourself. More importantly, Ken'ichirou-san."
99. [Rin] "This is the girl?"
100. [Ken'ichirou] "Yeah, this is the girl. Her name's Shizuku."
101. Seeing my face, Rin turned back to Ken'ichirou-san, looking delighted.
102. [Rin] "Wow, she's such a beautiful girl! Ken'ichirou-san!"
103. [Ken'ichirou] "That she is. The Natsume daughters are all beauties, more or less."
104. [Rin] "If I can move this girl, you'll let me use whatever mineral pigments I want, right? As promised?"
105. [Ken'ichirou] "Yeah, I'll give you the mineral pigments, as promised."
106. [Ai] "Mineral pigments? What are those?"
107. [Ken'ichirou] "Ah, just what it sounds like -- pigments made by crushing minerals and the like. They're used mainly for Japanese-style painting, though they get used elsewhere too, of course."
108. [Ai] "Hmm. A girl who wants pigments -- that's a rare one."
109. [Rin] "Mm. I'm going to paint the cherry blossoms with Ken'ichirou-san."
110. [Ai] "Paint the cherry blossoms?"
111. [Rin] "There's a place called Yumihari Hill one station over -- I want to paint the cherry trees there."
112. [Ken'ichirou] "She means the cherry trees at Yumihari Academy. The place I used to work. Come to think of it, wasn't that school your first choice too, Ai?"
113. [Ai] "That's right...... it's true, I did want to go there, since it was the school you and Mizuna-neesama attended......"
114. [Ai] "But a Natsume can't very well go to Yumihari Academy, can she."
