17. [Sui] "Originally, a Hakuki is something like a vessel that has no heart of its own.\nAnd precisely for that reason, she was able to accept the hearts of others in their entirety."
18. [Sui] "Shizuku wasn't complete, but she too possessed the power of a Hakuki.\nShe was drifting somewhere between human and Hakuki."
