47. [Sui] "I'm good at drawing things in, but I'm equally good at erasing them..."
48. [Naoya] "Even so, there's no way no one would be sad!"
49. [Sui] "See, you get angry for me like that.\nAll the more reason I have to erase the memories... I don't want you to feel any sadness, Kusanagi-san..."
