84. [Sui] "A series that laid out the aspects of death as sakura..."
85. [Naoya] "If that one was no good, I'll just work harder.\nI'll make an even greater work."
86. [Naoya] "A thousand-year cherry that stays with everyone so vividly your existence can never be erased!"
87. [Naoya] "I'll finish it, no matter what!"
88. [Sui] "Hehe... For someone so inconvenienced when it comes to talent, Kusanagi-san, you certainly do talk a big game..."
89. [Naoya] "Well, of course. Kei apparently said it himself.\nA genius makes you forget talent."
90. [Naoya] "Maybe I don't have talent, but I'm every bit as much a genius as you.\nAnd of course I won't be outdone by Kusanagi Ken'ichirou either."
91. [Naoya] "So I won't let anyone forget you. Not a chance!"
92. [NARRATION] Shizuku gently put her arm around Sui's shoulders.
