=== lines=137 stop_reason=end_turn in=6159 out=3468 cache_read=3222 cache_create=0 last_entry_continued=0 ===
1. "You're not eating?"
2. "You aren't either, Nao-kun..."
3. "Ah, you're right..."
4. "Hey, so..."
5. "Y-yes!?"
6. "Ah, no, I was just thinking... the weather's nice."
7. "Yes, it's lovely weather. And there's no one else here at all -- we've got this autumn sky all to ourselves."
8. "Hahaha, y-yeah... just the two of us."
9. "Y-yes... it's kind of been just the two of us for a while now, hasn't it?"
10. "Well, not many people know about this place..."
11. "But there are some who do know, right?"
12. "Even so, they wouldn't come at this hour. If they were going to eat lunch on the roof, they'd already be here with their lunchboxes open."
13. "That's true. Though, somehow, we've got ours open and haven't been eating either..."
14. "Yeah, you're right... hey, so..."
15. Rin and I looked into each other's eyes.
16. Her face was bright red, but her eyes were full of expectation.
17. Mine probably were too.
18. The reason we couldn't bring ourselves to eat our lunches was simple.
19. It was true for me, and it must have been true for Rin as well.
20. We'd been waiting a moment, checking too whether anyone might come...
21. ...so we could pick up where we left off yesterday.
22. When I gently brought my face closer, Rin's shoulders shrank a little.
23. She closed her eyes naturally.
24. It was a brief kiss.
25. It ended quickly, but we kept our faces close, gazing at each other.
26. Neither of us wanted it to end.
27. Neither of us spoke.
28. Even so, because we both felt reluctant to part, we couldn't move our faces away.
29. Our lips met again.
30. "Nn... mmh, ah... mmh..."
31. As our lips touched, Rin's warmth spread softly through me.
32. But lips alone weren't enough.
33. No matter how many times we pressed them together, it wasn't enough.
34. "Mm, mm... mmh..."
35. Rin's eyes were squeezed shut, and her lips had parted slightly.\nBeyond them, I could see her wet tongue.
36. "Nn? Ah, nn, mmh... mmh... mmh..."
37. The feel of her lips.\nRin's breath, and the faint, aching little sounds she made.\nA touch of lips that seemed to seek the other.
38. "Nn... mmh... nn, lick... slurp... hah..."
39. Without either of us starting it, our tongues intertwined.
40. Probably, as we kept kissing, both our mouths had gradually opened.
41. I slipped my tongue inside.\nI could feel myself entering into Rin's body.
42. As I drew it back, Rin's saliva and breath flowed into me.
43. Just from a kiss, I felt as if I were melting into Rin -- and then --
44. "Mmh, nn!? ...nnh............!!"
45. Rin suddenly shuddered all over.
46. "Puhah... haa, haa... nkuh... haa, haa..."
47. "I-I'm okay...
48. Ah, well, maybe I'm not okay, but..."
49. "Not okay how?"
50. "Ah, no, it's my problem. I'm fine. There's no issue at all."
51. "Um, can I go to the bathroom for a moment?"
52. "Ah, sure... no problem, but..."
53. "Oh, and could you eat a little of my lunch? I made a bit extra so you could have some, Nao-kun."
54. Rin hurried down the stairs from the roof.
55. What was that all about?
56. Out of breath, Rin came running back up the stairs.
57. "Haa, haa, I'm sorry. In the middle of our meal..."
58. "Well, it was more before the meal than during it.\nAnyway, sit down. There's not much of lunch break left."
59. Looking happy, Rin sat down beside me.
60. "Oh, you hadn't started eating at all yet?"
61. "Yeah. Knowing you, I figured you'd hurry back, so I waited."
62. "Uuh, I'm sorry. I'm sorry for so many things."
63. "Don't worry about it. Ah, this beef-wrapped burdock --"
64. Our meal with Rin began.
65. Swapping bits of each other's cooking, we savored the flavors.
66. As expected, Rin's cooking was absurdly delicious.
67. "This is good."
68. "Yes, your cooking is delicious too, Nao-kun."
69. It had been a slightly rushed lunch, but we managed to finish without running out of time.
70. "Well then, should we head back to the classroom?"
71. "Yes. Actually, maybe we didn't need to eat quite so fast."
72. "Yeah, we had more time than I thought."
73. "Ehehe, we did. That was fun."
74. It was a single gust of wind.
75. On a rooftop, a gust like that would be perfectly natural.
76. But it was the first wind we'd felt all day.
77. That was why we let our guard down.\nOr perhaps it was because we'd been so happily talking together.
78. The wind lifted Rin's skirt --
79. -- and I saw something I couldn't believe.
80. "Eh?"
81. Flustered, she tried to push down the hem of her skirt, but in her panic she couldn't quite manage it -- and all that while, the inside of her skirt was on full display.
82. Somehow, Rin got her skirt back down.
83. I had seen something incredible.
84. "D-d-di-did you see that?!"
85. Normally, I'd have been the shocked one, but Rin was so thoroughly flustered that I ended up feeling calm.
86. "Ah, well, it was only a moment... is what I'd like to say, but..."
87. "Y-you saw!?"
88. "Even so, I couldn't tell in detail.\nJust that... I couldn't confirm any underwear beneath your skirt..."
89. Rin's face went bright red, on the verge of tears.
90. Then she bowed her head with tremendous force.
91. "I'm so terribly sorry for having shown you such an unsightly thing!!"
92. "No, no, it wasn't unsightly at all, but... why aren't you wearing any, Rin? Do you have that kind of hob--"
93. "I do not!!"
94. "Do I have to give a reason? Am I obligated to explain?"
95. "Not really, but..."
96. "Then how do you plan to interpret what just happened?"
97. "Maybe you happened to forget them...? I did sort of gather it wasn't a hobby. I mean, I can't imagine you having a hobby like that..."
98. "I don't. There's absolutely no way I have that kind of hobby!\nAh, uuuh... how should I put this...\nHow can I explain..."
99. "No, you don't have to force yourself to explain..."
100. "Is what just happened something that can end without explanation? It's a big deal! Normally!"
101. "Well, that's true, but..."
102. "Obviously, I don't have that kind of hobby, and I certainly didn't do it just to show you on purpose."
103. "That much I understand."
104. "It's just that I didn't have time..."
105. "You mean this morning? You were up pretty early, but surely you had time to put on underwear?"
106. "O-of course. I didn't forget my underwear this morning!"
107. "Um, well... you see... how do I say this..."
108. "Look, if you don't want to explain, you don't have to."
109. "Um, s-so! It seems that I, well... have a rather shameless lower half..."
110. "A shameless lower half?"
111. "Oh, I don't mean I'm lewd or anything like that. Really!"
112. "No, that's not how I was taking it..."
113. "But 'shameless lower half' usually does mean that..."
114. "Um, w-well..."
115. "I've really been agonizing over it myself... how do I put this, lately -- very recently -- whenever I get excited...
116. I get really, really wet..."
117. "P-please don't make that face..."
118. "Ah, no, sorry.\nC-come to think of it, you did jokingly mention something like this before..."
119. "Yes... unfortunately, that wasn't a joke.\nIt never used to happen, but recently it's been so bad I don't know what to do."
120. "Honestly, even the slightest brush of a hand feels like it could soak through my underwear..."
121. "So, to my great embarrassment, from that kiss just now my underwear was in a terrible state... it was going to soak through to my skirt, so I wiped it off in the bathroom. And I took my underwear off in the process..."
122. "I -- I really did want to change into my gym clothes and then come back up! Of course I didn't want to walk around without underwear!\nB-but... I was running out of time..."
123. "I didn't want to waste even a moment of lunch break with you, Nao-kun..."
124. "Y-you must be disgusted, right? A girl who gets like that from just a kiss..."
125. "No, not at all. If a kiss got you that excited, I'm happy about it."
126. "O-of course I get excited!\nBecause -- because it's a kiss with you, Nao-kun, and I love you so much..."
127. "R-Rin... I-I see..."
128. "I -- I've spent my whole life thinking of nothing but you, Nao-kun... so of course, after a kiss that deep, I'd get excited."
129. "T-that's the greatest compliment a man could ask for... I'm grateful..."
130. "W-when you say kind things to try to smooth it over like that, I recover a little..."
131. "No, it's not that I'm smoothing anything over..."
132. "Ah, there's the bell."
133. "Ah, we'd better hurry."
134. "But before that, put your gym clothes on underneath!"
135. "O-of course! Even if I'm late, I'll put them on.\nThe reason I didn't wear them up to the roof is because I didn't want to lose even a single minute with you, Nao-kun!"
136. "R-right..."
137. She really does say things that make me happy.

