6. Hikawa Rina and Kawachino Yumi had both done landscapes.
7. Each depicted the view from the rooftop of this school.
8. Hikawa's was quite the accomplished work, but for some reason she skipped the Moore Exhibition.\nShe said she wanted to spend all three years aiming for it properly.
