13. Toritani had staked everything on this final year, so his disappointment was especially heavy, yet it isn't so simple that enthusiasm and passion alone can win an award.
14. If anything, the more astonishing thing is that a student could produce a work of this caliber while aiming at that goal.
15. Toritani afterward took the entrance exams for a national art university and passed with flying colors.
16. With skill like his, and academic ability that left nothing to be desired, it was a natural result.
