100. [Headmaster] "...Why, indeed."
101. The headmaster slowly drew on her cigarette.\nThe smoke she exhaled rose toward the sky.
102. A thin trail of smoke drifting into the sky.\n...It made me think, just a little, of spring.
103. She had said she attended Kusanagi Ken'ichirou's funeral.
104. [Headmaster] "What was it, I wonder. What was it I expected of him back then?"
