5. "You said just a moment ago I could call it whatever I liked.\nSo I shall become your little sister."
6. "Hold on, hold on -- 'little sister,' but we aren't related by blood or anything."
7. "Originally I wanted to be your disciple. Blood has nothing to do with it.\nIt's a spiritual thing. A spiritual little sister, if you will......"
8. "Wh-what is that even supposed to mean?"
9. "You hate the idea, don't you! If you hate it......"
10. "Aah, what a pain. Fine. If you want to be my 'spiritual little sister' or whatever, then fine."
11. "U-uuh...... You really are stubborn......"
12. "Huh? Me, stubborn? As if.\nGo on, then. Try saying it.\nCall me onii-chan. Can you do it? Huh?"
13. "Onii-chan <3"
14. "She said it like it was nothing! This kid just said it like it was nothing!\nAnd it sounded natural!"
15. "Also, onii-chan, thank you for everything up until today."
16. "Huh? For what?"
17. "You knew about my illness, didn't you. I was so terrified of the surgery for it that I did nothing but daydream about accepting death......"
18. "That's why you painted with me, Kusanagi-san...... A painting almost like a letter."
