20. "'What is that,' huh? You're playing dumb, right? Obviously?"
21. "Playing dumb? About what?"
22. "Y-you...... You knew Rina had a serious illness, and that's why you finished this painting, isn't it?"
23. "Hah? What are you talking about? Of course I didn't know. Nobody told me."
24. "B-but you were saying that stuff at the start.\nAll that difficult talk about how Hikawa-san's paintings looked like they were meekly accepting death or something!"
25. "No, that was more like a chuunibyou thing that comes with her age.\nThat's the sense in which I meant it."
26. "N-no way, I -- I thought you understood everything and were doing this on purpose, and because you were that kind of person, I......"
27. "No, no, how would I know something that private?!\nAnyway -- this kid here really was seriously ill?\nSeriously, are you okay?"
28. "Don't put on a phony show of concern!"
29. "H-hey, no violence!"
30. "Anyway -- Hikawa, was it?\nFor someone so sick, you paint with real force."
31. "I-I didn't want to lose......"
32. "I see. Either way, it was a good painting.\nHonestly, I thought I might get swallowed up by yours."
33. "Really? I didn't feel that way at all......\nOnly, I felt that you aimed straight at what you had to express, without wavering."
34. "Yeah, well. An artist's job is to make it look that way.\nEven when you're lost, you pretend you're not."
