68. Scratching my head, I passed through the station's ticket gate.

=== lines=125 stop_reason=end_turn in=4638 out=2959 cache_read=3222 cache_create=0 last_entry_continued=0 ===
1. "You weren't listening, were you?"
2. "What I said was..."
3. "It's okay if you don't keep watching over me all the time."
4. "Huh? ......"
5. "So, I'm saying you don't need to stay with me the whole time while I paint."
6. "If there's something on your mind, please spend your time on that instead."
7. "N-no, there isn't anything on my mind..."
8. "Yes, yes, I get it, so please take a little time for yourself."
9. "It's not like... I have plenty of time to myself at home..."
