82. "Rina-oneechaaan."
83. "Oh, Kusanagi-chan's here too."
84. "Why is Hikawa's little sister here?"
85. "Looks like the timing is just right."
86. "Just right? What are you here for, you two?"
87. "Ah, we were passing by, so I thought I'd say hi to Kusanagi-chan."
88. "Passing by? Yumihari Academy is way up on top of a hill..."
89. "That was a joke.\nJoking aside, I came here because I wanted to show Rina-oneesama this."
90. She showed us a photo on her phone.
91. There was a figure we recognized in it.
92. "I can only tell from the uniform and hairstyle, but this is probably... Nagayama Kana, isn't it..."
93. "Yeah, it's a bit far off and hard to make out, but it's probably her."
94. "But why does Kawachino's little sister have a photo of Nagayama?"
95. "Rina-oneesama told me to let her know if anything strange happened around us..."
96. "For the first few days after she told me, nothing happened, but just now, this person was loitering around in front of our house, so I got a picture..."
97. "In front of the Kawachino house?"
98. "Maybe she got wind of the rumors from that whole walk-to-school incident.\nLooks like Nagayama Kana has her eye on Yumi..."
99. "Who is she? Actually, we just passed by her at the school gate a moment ago..."
