101. "Stalking?"
102. "Yeah, she seems to be snooping around me.\nAnd it looks like Kawachino got dragged into it because of that..."
103. "Hey, hey, let Rurio see it too."
104. "Rurio-san, you wouldn't be able to tell who it was even if you saw it..."
105. Hikawa's little sister peeked at the phone.
106. "Wow, Yumi-oneechan's little sister Suzuna is really good at taking secret shots too..."
