116. "Hikawa, do you have photos of me?"
117. "N-no, it just happened by chance... just by chance..."
118. "By chance my foot -- you treasure them like crazy.\nRurio knows all about it. When Rina-oneechan looks at those photos, she's all alone, panting while she stares at them."
119. "Th-th-that's not--"
120. "What is she doing? Rurio has always wondered about that."
121. "U-um, well!\nT-the report is finished... so shall we head home soon?"
122. "Huh? Why? We just got here."
123. "It's fine, we're going home! Rurio-san!"
