26. "Kusanagi-kun chose Rina-chan."
27. "That isn't necessarily something joyful for me, but even so, I think it turned out for the best."
28. "Because I can watch over Kusanagi-kun being able to love someone......"
29. "Even if that someone isn't me......,\nI think coming back to Yumihari was worth it."
30. Senpai answered gently.
31. "Rin-senpai, Rin-senpai, I, I--"
32. My words wouldn't connect properly; I was only repeating the same words over and over.
33. "Aah, aah, don't look at me with those eyes!\nIt makes me look too pitiful!"
34. "I-I'm sorry......"
35. "L-look, my heart isn't made of steel either. I'm not some super-humanitarian who only wishes for other people's happiness......"
36. "I'm just a person too......\nSo......"
37. "Really, cheering you on......"
38. "But if that's what makes Nao-kun happy......"
39. Rin-senpai was smiling, but her voice had gone nasal.
40. Tears were welling up in her eyes.
41. What a person she is......
42. What a kind person......
43. My heart ached.
44. "Anyone can love......"
45. "Anyone can fall in love......"
46. "But being joined together isn't easy......"
47. "That's exactly why! You have to do it properly!"
48. "Otherwise, the other people won't be rewarded."
49. "It isn't just Yumi-chan."
50. "To love someone means, sometimes, hurting somebody."
51. "Because love is that great a feeling......"
52. "So you mustn't run from your own feelings out of fear of hurting someone."
53. "You have to face your own love properly."
54. "Even if it means hurting others......"
55. "Yeah, I got a little preachy there.\nSorry......"
56. "No......"
57. "But that's the one thing I wanted to say."
58. "A word of advice from the loser to the victor......"
59. "No, calling it advice is a lie.\nI just want to entrust what I couldn't do to Rina-chan......"
60. "That's the least of my wishes......"
61. "Make Nao-kun happy...... Rina-chan......"
62. With those words, without even waiting for my answer, Rin-senpai vanished from the rooftop.
63. Rin-senpai is a strange person......
64. What is it -- when I first met her, I thought she was just a simply kind onee-san type of person......
65. Not at all.
66. If I were in the opposite position, could I do the same thing?
67. With someone like her at his side, would senpai really choose someone like me?
68. Is there anyone who could envelop senpai in a love as great as Rin-senpai's?
69. "I......"

