1. [Ken'ichirou] "Probably because we're mammals."
2. [Mizuna] "Because we're mammals?"
3. [Ken'ichirou] "Yeah, mammals are all held by their parents and given milk.\nThis warmth is the warmth you felt right after being born.\nSo everyone knows it."
4. [Mizuna] "I see...... B-but,"
5. [Mizuna] "Ah, no, n-never mind, it's nothing......"
6. [Ken'ichirou] "It's that, right. When you were held by that man, it felt disgusting."
