8. [Ken'ichirou] "It's fine. Because that's an important thing."
9. [Mizuna] "An important thing?"
10. [Ken'ichirou] "That's right. People, you see. People feel warm because they're being held by someone they love. That's when they can truly feel warmth in their heart."
11. [Ken'ichirou] "The body heat of someone you don't love is nothing but pain."
12. [Mizuna] "Because you love......\nKen'ichirou-san, isn't my warmth painful to you?"
13. [Ken'ichirou] "Of course not. I love you, Mizuna, so it can't be anything but pleasant."
14. [Mizuna] "Really, is that so, is that so? But, but, when I hear that,"
15. [Ken'ichirou] "When you hear that?"
16. [Mizuna] "I -- I don't know...... inside my heart it's so warm...... And so......"
17. [Mizuna] "What is this...... why, when my heart is warm......"
18. [NARRATION] Tears spilled in fat drops from Mizuna's eyes, falling onto me.
19. [Mizuna] "I-I'm sorry. I've gotten your face wet. Why am I crying? Why, why am I. I'm not sad or anything......"
20. [Ken'ichirou] "People don't only cry when they're sad. People cry when they're happy too."
