28. [Mizuna] "My body was defiled. And so my heart torments me."
29. [Mizuna] "My heart and my body......\nJust what were these two things, I always used to wonder."
30. [Ken'ichirou] "Your body isn't defiled, Mizuna.\nYou're just the one who thinks so."
31. [Ken'ichirou] "And that heart of yours, the one that tormented you,\nis now warming you from inside."
32. [Ken'ichirou] "If you had to sum up how you feel right now in a word, what would it be?"
33. [Mizuna] "I wonder, what word would fit......\nI can't think of one. I've never felt this way before......"
34. [Ken'ichirou] "Happiness, isn't it?"
35. [Mizuna] "Happiness? Ah, I see...... so this is the feeling called happiness......"
36. [Mizuna] "Yes, I -- right now, I might be happy......"
