38. [Ken'ichirou] "You mustn't hate your heart. Even if you do, your heart won't go away. It will only hurt."
39. [Ken'ichirou] "You mustn't hate your body. Even if you do, only your heart will suffer......"
40. [Mizuna] "Whether you hate your heart or hate your body, what hurts is...... the heart, isn't it."
