42. [Ken'ichirou] "The heart is not the body. The body is not the heart."
43. [Ken'ichirou] "And yet, the heart is the body, and the body is the heart."
44. [Ken'ichirou] "Different, yet the same thing."
45. [Ken'ichirou] "A difference in wording. Or a crossing of words. That's all it is."
46. [Ken'ichirou] "So, Mizuna, be kind to your own body, be kind to your own heart."
47. [Mizuna] "Be kind to my own body and heart?"
48. [Ken'ichirou] "That's right. Don't torment yourself, don't shut yourself in. It's okay to be more happy."
49. [Mizuna] "Happy, me?"
50. [Ken'ichirou] "That's right. It's okay to be more happy."
51. [Mizuna] "Happy...... for me to be happy...... uh......"
52. [NARRATION] From Mizuna's already-tearful eyes, tears welled up once more.
53. [Mizuna] "For me, to be happy, for me to be happy......\nu, uuu...... waaah!"
54. [NARRATION] Mizuna cried out in a loud voice.
55. [NARRATION] Just like a little child, "waaah," Mizuna wailed.
56. [NARRATION] She had denied her heart.
57. [NARRATION] She had denied her body.
58. [NARRATION] She had denied herself.
59. [NARRATION] Now she stopped doing that.
60. [NARRATION] And then the tears came pouring out.
