80. [NARRATION] Afterward, the Nakamura family was cornered by the Natsume clan.
81. [NARRATION] The Nakamura, who had only been playing at being yakuza, had no power to stand against the Natsume family, real underworld men.
82. [NARRATION] The Nakamura were thoroughly driven out of Yumihari City's underworld, and the shock rippled even into their legitimate businesses.
83. [NARRATION] Before the war, the Nakamura had held absolute power.
84. [NARRATION] After the war, they had gradually weakened, allowing the rise of the Natsume clan.
