98. [NARRATION] Under the circumstances, it was only natural that the Natsume clan would drive the Nakamura into a corner.
99. [NARRATION] By every means at their disposal, the Natsume clan pressed the Nakamura.
100. [NARRATION] The Nakamura, who had gradually lost their strength, could not come up with one billion yen in cash, and proposed settling the matter at this mansion.
101. [NARRATION] Naturally, the old woman Natsume wouldn't hear of it.
