20. "Really? When you were little, at times like this you always looked like you were about to cry......"
21. "I-it's not like I ever let you see me shed a tear......"
22. "I'm saying that's how it looked, that's all."
23. "E-either way, that's back when I was a brat.\nI'm not gonna cry at my age......"
24. "You're right. That's true...... but for now, just let me do this."
25. Ai's chest was warm.
26. It was, sure enough, a nostalgic feeling.
27. Before I knew it, my trembling had stopped.
28. "Thanks. The shaking's settled down."
29. "So? Why are you up on the roof at this hour today?"
30. "I'd like to say 'no reason in particular,' but......"
