39. I turned and looked down over the school grounds from the roof.
40. There was the silhouette of that unmistakable girl.
41. She was walking off toward the side of the chapel.
42. "Th-there she is."
43. "That's the girl you were looking for?"
44. "Yeah, sorry, I'm going after her!"
45. "I see...... mm, do your best -- just don't overdo it."
46. I raced down the stairs.
47. This spot again.
48. Beside the chapel, where that mural was.
49. "Sui!"
50. "How noisy. What is it, Kusanagi-san?"
51. Sui turned around.
52. "You promised me something once, remember?"
