104. 　With this guy,\nI can no longer walk?
105. 　Together with this guy,\nI can no longer paint?
106. 　Such a stupid thing --\ncan it really be?
107. 　I mean, Kei won a world-class prize.
108. 　When you say the Moore's Elan Otarie, you know. That's a hell of a prize.
109. 　A height that artists the world over yearn for, and cannot reach even after devoting their whole lives.
110. 　That includes me.
111. 　I was one of those who did not reach it.
