126. 　So... come on... smile...
127. 　Purple smoke swirls up.
128. 　It is just like the swarm of butterflies I painted.
129. 　Beautiful and fantastical.
130. 　But the reality beneath it, its outlines strangely sharp, is fearfully clear.
131. 　The butterflies do not smile.
132. 　They only take flight.
133. 　Toward a place that is no land at all,
134. 　the butterflies, who do not smile, go.
135. 　Toritani was collapsed in tears.
136. 　Shizuku looked as though her soul had been drawn out of her.
137. 　Akashi was furious.
138. 　Rin did not come to the funeral.
139. 　As for me... Kei,
140. 　I only\nstood there in a daze, neither crying nor raging.
141. 　Because there were far too many emotions, and I couldn't even tell which one was the greatest.
142. 　Ah,
143. 　reality is clear.
144. 　Reality is
145. 　fearfully transparent,\nand bottomless.

