12. [Headmaster] "I'll be off soon. I'm busy too."
13. [Headmaster] "Well then -- try not to get too gloomy."
14. [Naoya] "Headmaster."
15. [Headmaster] "......what?"
16. [Naoya] "I've caused you a great deal of trouble!"
17. [Headmaster] "Trouble? You didn't do anything this time, did you?"
18. [Naoya] "This time... yeah."
19. [Headmaster] "......pfft."
20. [Headmaster] "Ahahahahaha."
21. [Headmaster] "Ah, well, never mind. Just assume that until the press comes, there'll be a few days -- no, less than three days."
22. [Naoya] "Yes. I imagine that's how it will be."
23. [Headmaster] "Even Kusanagi Ken'ichirou spent quite a lot of time designing it, you know?"
24. [Headmaster] "And Akashi-kun took several years to prepare."
25. [Naoya] "But Bourbagi pulled it off in a single night."
26. [Headmaster] "That's because the construction people were moving. With Director Murayama's backup, they were able to complete the work in a day."
27. [Naoya] "No doubt. A mural in a single day isn't something artists can do alone.\nHearing that Director Murayama's in construction really made it click."
28. [Headmaster] "Yes. They must have brought in heavy machinery and been at work since last night."
29. [Naoya] "In that case, the headmaster being away on business may not have been coincidence either."
30. [Headmaster] "You mustn't be so suspicious of the people who fund us.\nLet's chalk that up to coincidence."
31. [Naoya] "I suppose so."
32. [Headmaster] "Do you have a chance of winning?"
33. [Naoya] "Winning or not... I just apologized to you, Headmaster, that's all..."
34. [Headmaster] "Ahahahahaha, that's impressive. Impressive. You really are something."
35. [Headmaster] "Only, I have no idea what you're planning to do~"
36. [Naoya] "I understand perfectly."
37. [Headmaster] "Ahahaha, truly, the Kusanagi are an interesting lot."
38. [NARRATION] Laughing, the headmaster disappeared toward the stairs.
39. [Naoya] "It should show up... probably..."
40. [NARRATION] From the rooftop, I was connecting three particular objects into a triangle.
