42. [Naoya] "It should hold together... probably..."
43. [NARRATION] In theory, that is......
44. [NARRATION] But theory and reality are different things.
45. [Naoya] "It's a strange thing."
46. [NARRATION] What I'm about to attempt now is probably an impossible task.
47. [NARRATION] Six months, or at the very shortest one month.
48. [NARRATION] No, one month would be pushing it.
49. [NARRATION] In other words, pulling it off in less than three days is absolutely impossible.
